{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Map Minded 是一款以世界地理為主題的問答遊戲，結合地標尋找、國旗辨認、大陸重組與首都問答，適合熱愛旅行、地理知識或益智挑戰的玩家。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-115.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多元地理遊戲挑戰</h2>\n<p>遊戲提供十二款地理挑戰，玩家可在 80 秒內尋找 10 個地標，亦可繪畫國旗、配對國旗與國家、重組大陸版圖，並透過首都、國名、剪影及字母題測試知識。程式收錄超過 1,000 個地標，另有隱藏旅人 Wolly 搜尋、國家資料查閱、距離量度、時區顯示與旅行足跡記錄，讓玩家邊玩邊認識世界。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-96-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-97-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-98-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-99-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-100-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-112-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Map Minded</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/map-minded/id6808182718?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.652719+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:16:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:09.265653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.662742+00:00","content_hash":"82ddc39cb947ed46f4f83bcdf97ae11c8c232e24a62f0a8e228c80ffccf38ca5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.652719+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}